# Architecture

Vertical slices in WebApp. **Core** = entities only. **Infrastructure** = EF, MailKit, Foundry (ports + `DTOs.cs` per concern). **WebApp/Features** = use cases + repositories. **MediatR** (`lib/MediatR`) = CQRS — not the Jimmy Bogard NuGet package.

## Solution layout

```text
databases/Database/     SQL Server project (not under src/)
lib/MediatR/            CQRS dispatcher — see lib/MediatR/README.md
src/Core/               Entities only
src/Infrastructure/     Persistence, Mailbox/, Foundry/ + AddInfrastructure()
src/WebApp/             UI, Features, AI, composition root (Startup)
```

**References:** `Infrastructure → Core` · `MediatR` standalone · `WebApp → Infrastructure` + `MediatR`

## Where new code goes

| Question | Place |
|----------|--------|
| DB table / domain field | `Core/Entities/` (POCOs — no data annotations; validate on `Request`) |
| Mailbox port + models | `Infrastructure/Mailbox/` (`Abstractions.cs`, `DTOs.cs`, `Helpers.cs`, `MailKitMailboxService`) |
| Foundry port + config | `Infrastructure/Foundry/` (`Abstractions.cs`, `DTOs.cs`, `Helpers.cs`, `FoundryAgentFactory`) |
| Use case (Request/Handler) | `WebApp/Features/{Slice}/Commands\|Queries/{UseCase}.cs` |
| Slice read shape | `WebApp/Features/{Slice}/DTOs.cs` |
| Cross-slice read shape | `WebApp/Features/Shared/DTOs.cs` |
| Slice data access | `WebApp/Features/{Slice}/Repository.cs` |
| Cross-slice data access | `WebApp/Features/Shared/Repository.cs` |
| `Result`, pipeline, `IMediator` | `lib/MediatR/` |
| AI turn shapes, app constants | `WebApp/Models/` |
| LLM, tools, orchestration, memory | `WebApp/AI/` |
| Blazor UI | `WebApp/Components/` |
| HTTP API | `WebApp/Endpoints/*Endpoints.cs` |

**Not in WebApp:** `AppDbContext`, entities.

## WebApp folders

| Folder | Purpose |
|--------|---------|
| **Features/** | Vertical slices + `Shared/` — see `feature-slice-conventions.mdc` |
| **Components/** | Blazor — see `blazor-conventions.mdc` |
| **AI/** | Agents, tools, `ChatOrchestrator`, `Memory/` — see `ai-conventions.mdc` |
| **Models/** | `AI.cs`, `Constants.cs`, `Enums.cs` — see `dto-conventions.mdc` |
| **Endpoints/** | MVC `*Endpoints.cs`; `/api/...` only |
| **Utilities/** | Extensions, Helpers, Services (`UserMailboxService`, `CurrentUser`) — no EF/MailKit impl |

## Startup (`Startup.cs`)

- `InjectData` → `AddInfrastructure(configuration)` + `UserMailboxService`
- `InjectFeatures` → `AddFeatureRepositories()` + `AddMediatR(Assembly.GetExecutingAssembly())`
- `InjectAi` → agents, tools, orchestrator, memory services + `Configure<FoundryOptions>`

## Foundry

`Foundry:Enabled`, `Foundry:Endpoint`, `Foundry:ApiKey` in user secrets / env — never commit keys.

